{"ID":"20240220132634-625oi9m","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132634-625oi9m","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132634-625oi9m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161655-mtgkppx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161705-et3dry2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161705-et3dry2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:122,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:122\u0026#125;","title":"【茯苓甘草汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312161704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312161655-mtgkppx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161655-mtgkppx","updated":"20240312161655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第七十九条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161655-9zhdgxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161655-9zhdgxj","updated":"20240312161655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,汗出而渴者,「五苓散」主之。不渴而心下悸者,「茯苓甘草汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161655-n82e28b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161655-n82e28b","updated":"20240312161655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒汗流出来就好了，但病人并没有完全好，还有些燥渴。五苓散主之。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中医治症汗吐下法。当你汗吐下之后，怎么知道他好了没有？就是口渴不渴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如吃坏肚子，上吐下泻完了，口渴要找水喝了，代表坏的食物统统排出来了，这个时候慢慢喝点水，不要太快。如果不口渴，代表还有坏死的食物，没有清干净。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161655-bers829","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161655-bers829","updated":"20240312161655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"七十九条，如果汗出而渴，代表津液伤到了，用五苓散补回来。如果是渴而发烧，很燥热就不是五苓散了，五苓散只管渴，如果很热还渴的话是白虎汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161655-ewzqp8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161655-ewzqp8y","updated":"20240312161655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不渴而心下悸者，代表水还没有透发。这个时候茯苓甘草汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161655-jyebxgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161655-jyebxgi","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓甘草汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161655-n8x8a2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161655-n8x8a2g","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓二两，桂枝二两去皮，生姜三两切，甘草一两炙。右四味,以水四升,煮取二升,去滓,分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161655-epdceg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161655-epdceg9","updated":"20240312161655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝、茯苓等量。这个是把心下动悸的水利掉。同时桂枝降冲逆，茯苓能够利水。生姜甘草把津液补回来。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161703-z4cvfs7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161703-z4cvfs7"}},{"ID":"20240312161704-3prb7lm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161704-3prb7lm","updated":"20240312161704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百七十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161705-vca3ci2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161705-vca3ci2","updated":"20240312161705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」，厥而心下悸者，宜先治水，当服「茯苓甘草汤」，却治其厥，不尔，水渍入胃，必作利也。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161705-0y3h6ws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161705-0y3h6ws","updated":"20240312161705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒，手脚冰冷，里面是寒，体寒，心下悸，宜先治水。如果说病人有心下悸，同时有厥阴有寒，你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先治心下悸，再去治其他的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。心下悸应该是桂枝甘草汤。肚脐下动悸才是茯苓甘草，这个条辨弄错了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161705-et3dry2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161705-et3dry2","updated":"20240312161705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果说没有把这个水排掉，却治寒厥，造成这个水跑到胃里面去，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先要把水排掉，再治他的厥逆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。先把他动悸的现象排掉，因为动悸并不是在胃里面，而是在周围。如果用四逆汤治冷，恶寒，厥逆，手脚冰冷，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四逆汤干姜是温中的，只到胃的里面去，胃的外面上方没有办法到。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]}